msgstr "get(name)                  - 获取参数值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:24
#: 19686344c70c414fb2f7339f03c3bc92 3b9b8050205e4361985cebf098eec6b4
#: 5cc3f172cc6f40baae3ce6666b0ba53c adf26219e58a40e38a716121068d2673
