msgstr "set(name, value)           - 设置参数值但不保存到非易失性存储"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:25
#: 11b81d3dc08a4d489120ebc069ba4a09 1d405dcc57c5414e9a73b58b2edb1dc1
#: 590d59e18dba4604975890ca9ecd02a1 76ef9d9abad64073bc5218a28145cb8e
#: 9ba849065a9c4f2a8384cf98dd1da7f8 e3c0bb7937294713882f5e8aec5ca32d
