msgstr "set_and_save(name, value)  - 设置参数值并保存到非易失性存储"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:26
#: 45eaf528de0542acac65b23f8ac2c7b1 4730948a418649e68fc4302f8a490fbc
#: 59c5c89d29554b8ba485f2d1b7299550 69f2a61a7f4c4fda80829a76e5269e4d
#: bab3b7e68d974469aca26911f5a17a3b fba27667ff7e4ae3ab4cbcf9fdcfb2eb
msgid "set_default(name, value)   -changes the default value"
msgstr "set_default(name, value)   - 更改默认值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:28
#: 15ce9f7eccd94498ba853b2b851870cf 26343985c20c442e9a936febe5e729cf
#: 3125edaeca314d3d9bb91b2cd26f5801 998e9d69e9f642488109ad2f8517f728
#: b976065041b74c27812b54f8163b3a37 e3ed36280ce24d98ad234a9f1f0f012e
msgid ""
"For Parameter objects the above access methods apply also, but without the "
"name arguments since the Parameter object should already be initialized and "
"no slow name search is required, and the following methods are applicable:"
msgstr ""
"对于Parameter对象，上述访问方法同样适用，但不需要名称参数（因为Parameter对象应已初始化，无需慢速名称搜索），以下方法也适用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:30
#: 0373bba5ed1a4e4f83b09f90a3e99073 4c7e5d9c97ab42da83ed71a214c30a60
#: 5802fb8a4d9f497b9d7e4666794acdb6 58c517d2cd9f43eea0f2abace08f4b8d
#: 9898a8033c334ec3a2572ebcca2186bb 9ae4e178c02740ab98f6287d89e77bed
msgid "init(name)                          -initializes a parameter object"
msgstr "init(name)                          - 初始化参数对象"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:31
#: 2b6b263733624dedb92c2ff19c32002f 8f49f26d619048f584f07b95b344739a
#: c82d6360f71143a8a48f30c6cb9557e0 e9f741ea784f43c88cc953e2c1887fca
#: f1cc78af381c47648b326f07a0d6e79c f1d740c6d51e409b9aa61702696ef623
msgid ""
"configured()                        -check to see if a Parameter object has "
"been initialized"
msgstr "configured()                        - 检查Parameter对象是否已初始化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:34
#: 048aef23ab97426588d8e7e7fb521212 3489549be95c4d97911a71cfa3f7192e
#: 3e44a87edb3b4c4ebd10b37e1a0ad020 51a9b0b1d272418a8ad199ea74426456
#: 7ac9ca2654104685afd7d59788c36b8b f7e924d0a0fd48198cf34589dd84afac
msgid "Adding Parameters"
msgstr "添加参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:36
#: 3d37d700769e4699b172ccc251669130 42665b70475d43baab40823f50bca06d
#: 514cc49b2efc4e01bf9ec4c31a5a0e82 bfdee06503f74b6a8461c37f4f914595
#: cedf707e5ef043fa84d987daa5ac73a4 dc0ae9b01ac848fc963d08d90a07a277
msgid ""
"In addition to accessing/modifying existing parameters created by the "
"firmware, LUA scripts can add new parameters for use by any LUA script. "
"These parameters behave the same as those created and used by the firmware "
"in that they can be read/written and saved into non-volatile memory that "
"persists across reboots and power cycles."
msgstr ""
"除了访问/修改固件创建的现有参数外，LUA脚本还可以添加供任意LUA脚本使用的新参数。这些参数与固件创建和使用的参数行为相同，可以读写并保存到非易失性存储中，跨重启和断电仍然保留。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:38
#: 41f03b57770c446087e5e5294de53fa9 7e91f3efb10841759701f60f07098bab
#: 8d663dbdea5449da82739f6f2d098a08 c811831be64d4e8f9faed22164546a35
#: e13f381042fe44449c2d2bf56f915429 ef49198117bd49299e9a45254fa42c4e
msgid ""
"However, unlike firmware parameters they behave slightly differently. "
"Firmware parameters are reset to their default values upon a parameter reset"
" or when changing firmware to a different vehicle type. Scripting created "
"parameters do not. In fact, scripting created parameters are invisible "
"unless a script actually \"re-creates\" them within a script."
msgstr ""
"但与固件参数不同，它们的行为略有差异。固件参数在参数重置或更换固件到不同飞行器类型时会重置为默认值，而脚本创建的参数不会。事实上，脚本创建的参数是不可见的，除非脚本在脚本内实际「重新创建」它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:40
#: b10630035dba4cc5a024243644ef59a5
msgid ""
"This is explained below in the section :ref:`How Parameters Work in "
"ArduPilot <how-params-work>`. Suffice it to say that there must a script "
"running that \"creates\" the new parameters as discussed below on any given "
"bootup, in order to use them and for ground control stations like Mission "
"Planer to list them."
msgstr ""
"这在 :ref:`ArduPilot参数的工作原理 <how-params-work>` "
"部分有详细说明。简而言之，在任何给定的启动时，必须有一个运行中的脚本如下所述「创建」新参数，才能使用它们，并让Mission "
"Planner等地面站列出它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:43
#: 3ee14bbef2e04bae97386bbb5ad86c9e 570a2125be6143249e59bacd76d8dffa
#: 8029f921c1de44798fff5bf5727b2ed7 82dde41ed6e4495d8a54392995d51801
#: 8841738aa14340b1bc6cb19a6eb6ccb3 9a29e6504d664496a8e50344fd09ff95
msgid "Creating a Parameter Group"
msgstr "创建参数组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:45
#: 053b03fddbf04c2286f856c35c046045 0c3e30dbd081485fb5900205f9d42797
#: 8a2a2b7f1b374e7b8f957bbc98350f5e 9853b8301d964b788996846004686024
#: c4f87232d8d94242a49b0de8b35054e8 fe7bccd42657489794779d9952b3d7e8
msgid ""
"Groups of up to 63 parameters can created within a script using the "
"\"add_table\" command. ::"
msgstr "在脚本中可以使用「add_table」命令创建最多63个参数的组：::"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:50
#: 1992802669764691930c6894b2638d9d 2700d0652cb2416db3fa5bf0db6f6a0f
#: 54ce7d2d7f4e41b4a6786e2dfa886d72 a7c6ac605ee1444fbdc10a20a0cdc420
#: b2d7d730801048d5b3018a316f9a37c1 c54cec227f3945c4890ea5491fd80b55
msgid ""
"This defines a unique table key (0 - 200) to identify the parameter storage "
"area in memory, so that different scripts can have different parameters, if "
"desired. The next command creates a 30 slot table for parameters with names "
"beginning \"AERO\\_\" and uses the LUA assert error command to halt the "
"script if it cannot be created for some reason (like lack of memory space or"
" conflicts with another script trying to add a table with the same key)"
msgstr ""
"这定义了一个唯一的表键（0 - "
"200）来标识内存中的参数存储区域，以便不同脚本可以拥有不同的参数（如需要）。下一条命令创建一个30个槽位的参数表，参数名以「AERO\\_」开头，并使用LUA的assert错误命令在无法创建时（如内存空间不足或与另一个尝试添加相同键的表的脚本冲突）停止脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:52
#: 020c3f36053143318bea70df558cc839 06e57bde7ce1433cb998fa29e2757155
#: 2d821532191d463cba49f2bf577327e0 480a8101f2d84a389c43c84a908e2a2f
#: 5cbfedd941eb43058d89723e2d27e23f fccb1ea8c15e4b09ac2e5c2a0148a54d
msgid "Next, individual parameters can be added. ::"
msgstr "接下来可以添加各个参数：::"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:57
#: 56f1b851843d44aab2cfbc0434d264bc 7a1bdb321caf408688fe9b8ad2d20c6a
#: 9b41c8c5f7ce493fb19900054d1f422f c4720f46c5e5412ab324fa661a60686d
#: ead69f203ba54e51b58f5bfe31a49e91 fee7490a93f245b995b6c704c174b420
msgid ""
"This adds two parameters, AERO_TRICK_ID and AERO_RPT_COUNT, with indexes 1 "
"and 2, and initial values of 0 to that table. Other concurrently running "
"scripts could also add other parameters as long as they do not overlap index"
" numbers. Those scripts would use the \"param:add_table\" method with the "
"same prefix (\"AERO\" in the above example) and key, and then add parameters"
" with \"param\"add_param\" methods as above. Calling the \"param:add_table\""
" with the same key and prefix in two concurrently running scripts does not "
"create an error."
msgstr ""
"这向该表中添加了两个参数AERO_TRICK_ID和AERO_RPT_COUNT，索引分别为1和2，初始值均为0。其他并发运行的脚本也可以添加其他参数，只要它们的索引号不重叠。这些脚本将使用相同前缀（上例中为「AERO」）和键的「param:add_table」方法，然后使用「param:add_param」方法如上添加参数。在两个并发运行的脚本中使用相同的键和前缀调用「param:add_table」不会产生错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:59
#: 1ce79a94fcd4420caa5b9b1fd996e7dd 6c20166aad5941718cd6f7b22410f82a
#: 887a0a8dd42543298bd500dc95893a8c be3a2cd8a87d4e8cade397b9fef6e9da
#: cea61e0dd5bc43f680635c27afde8921 f30a06eb2c0b4761810fef9fe96bf14f
msgid ""
"if there are other con-currently running scripts that will try to access "
"these parameters, be sure to delay their first updates until the script "
"adding the parameters has time to complete the setup process since each "
"script is run independently in its own thread"
msgstr ""
"如果有其他并发运行的脚本将尝试访问这些参数，请确保延迟它们的首次更新，直到添加参数的脚本有时间完成设置过程，因为每个脚本在各自的线程中独立运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:61
#: 0b9b1b46fe7e4c1ba25c625710c032c0 11c9e06a84e94ba485b9588129c281a4
#: 26f7b3f5b40f4b1aaf4e6ba93adc225b 314e3229265b4e76a001106b2a1ca934
#: adb3ded3dba84cf4845166e745ac9b91 d0c70c494d3a40b7adc6036e7d970429
msgid "These may now be accessed just like any other parameter. ::"
msgstr "现在可以像任何其他参数一样访问这些参数：::"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:67
#: 359254b4799d4ae8b988a05c1e26e4fa 822efef579b54da59ce11880c8bfc202
#: acba663f279a44ffb040c70f024ed5aa e229c44e78594eb7b8fd4374206bf977
#: e6859f8ebe7446fcb3c4e24ca800ed4b f563eee8a9a3439f96ac946de1f53e22
msgid ""
"all scripting defined parameters are of type FLOAT, ie floating point "
"numbers"
msgstr "所有脚本定义的参数类型均为FLOAT，即浮点数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:72
#: 22fb77c78142442997148f615be7ce14 98eeb31e40894c419f38e7afc22bd767
#: af10e166d77e42b8a5ec653716191e01 d7141713a09841b28483c6dec88f1d91
#: e92c576c343649debfc2b04018462fd1 f83611f59d5f44439c3d13e9913e2d78
msgid "How Parameters Work in ArduPilot"
msgstr "ArduPilot中参数的工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:74
#: 12850a94b5c443dfa69e5ab56752a44e 250d2a1b8d194d168d3085ad84b5c20c
#: 6ca3849b2dc246bba06ed0663c97a6ef 8db7e208c2e6446980597bc4ae6259ad
#: 93a05d9a21c44f20b96f762b4a616525 ffc0c3e59d0c4a539e8b6a64fb3d194c
msgid ""
"Parameters are defined in the firmware. Each parameter has a name, a default"
" value, and value type(boolean,float, integer 8,etc). Upon boot up, the "
"firmware creates RAM variables for each parameter and initializes them with "
"a value. That value is the default if the parameter has never been changed "
"by a user, or a value that has been stored in EEPROM of the autopilot, if it"
" has been changed from default. If the parameters have been \"reset\" by the"
" user (see :ref:`common-parameter-reset`) then the EEPROM storage for "
"changes is blank and all default values are used."
msgstr ""
"参数在固件中定义。每个参数都有名称、默认值和值类型（布尔、浮点、8位整数等）。启动时，固件为每个参数创建RAM变量并用值初始化。如果用户从未更改该参数，该值为默认值；如果已从默认值更改，则为存储在飞控EEPROM中的值。如果用户已「重置」参数（参见"
" :ref:`common-parameter-reset`），则EEPROM中的更改存储为空，所有参数使用默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:77
#: 05b53a4620bf4785b6b7436fc93e18da 2f5daeb23ddf4ebf9bc5e4ac47a4af28
#: 91099483a82843e18045454f521d0fe7 ec3c37797a0046e88857e65e82311f61
#: f4979cb5e90543608b2a5f7df1ad5a1a fca845a66ab742f098eb9e90e6641526
msgid ""
"The string names of the parameters are only used by the Ground Control "
"Stations and LUA scripts. Access from within the C++ code is directly to "
"addresses of the initialized parameter variables in RAM while executing, not"
" by name strings."
msgstr "参数的字符串名称仅由地面站和LUA脚本使用。C++代码内部访问是直接通过执行时RAM中初始化的参数变量地址，而不是通过名称字符串。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:79
#: 8b4a5b6df01844d19185ce9f791f5141
msgid ""
"LUA created parameters exist in the same manner as firmware created "
"parameters. User/Script changes are stored in non-volatile memory. But their"
" names only exist for a lookup if a \"param:add_table\" and "
"\"param:add_param\" has been executed after bootup by a script. Then they "
"will appear in the GCS parameter list and can be accessed by name from LUA "
"scripts. Without this, the data would still exist in non-volatile memory, "
"but is invisible and non-existent for all intents and purposes."
msgstr ""
"LUA创建的参数以与固件创建参数相同的方式存在。用户/脚本的更改存储在非易失性存储中。但它们的名称只有在启动后脚本执行了「param:add_table」和「param:add_param」之后才存在于查找中。然后它们将出现在GCS参数列表中，并可从LUA脚本按名称访问。没有这个，数据仍然存在于非易失性存储中，但对所有实际目的而言是不可见和不存在的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:81
#: 3d3d5d6160b240cfa6b8c99210de0a3e 81df9ae6f2094d3e9fb510b3f6c5c3d6
#: a6dc295b589d4285b3318e2b9b9f78f5 b561f5e049b346d1b1d0b52403ecb7c2
#: d1b21a802ed54df29baba713c4b09b78 eb10d08bde7b4e18b66365886fc5e896
msgid ""
"This also means that parameters created by one script, which are modified by"
" a user or script, are still in storage. If that script is removed, another "
"script with different parameters is run, then removed, and the original "
"script re-run, those changed parameters will re-appear in the GCS with their"
" last values and can be accessed again by the script. Resetting all the "
"parameters to defaults will erase those changes, just like the firmware "
"created parameters."
msgstr ""
"这也意味着由一个脚本创建、被用户或脚本修改的参数仍然保存在存储中。如果该脚本被删除，运行了另一个具有不同参数的脚本，然后又删除，再重新运行原始脚本，那些更改过的参数将以其最后的值重新出现在GCS中，并可再次被脚本访问。将所有参数重置为默认值将清除这些更改，与固件创建的参数一样。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:83
#: 0783761207994db6b4d8184863e47255 23952ef9e7e64e08a4ae398b6bc0a0f7
#: 4cd22a8e6f714cc7b120b5993df48594 50f96f908972428087dbdb845c83edd9
#: a1366c42ae204d07b8eb6c2c3a5a5d47 f839027d99fb41b6904bc4e04b79322a
msgid ""
"From LUA scripts you can access any parameter (created by firmware or by LUA"
" script) by name. However, that is slow since the LUA interpreter must do a "
"long string name search each time. Instead, using a Parameter() object and "
"initializing it, gives the address pointers to that named parameter's "
"location for direct accessing it quickly."
msgstr ""
"在LUA脚本中，您可以通过名称访问任何参数（固件创建或LUA脚本创建的）。但这速度较慢，因为LUA解释器每次都需要进行长字符串名称搜索。而使用Parameter()对象并对其进行初始化，可以获取该命名参数位置的地址指针，从而快速直接访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:40
#: 140a4217d57640ce84fafaff298da674 5906a085b27f4d38839cbe82fea140b5
#: 9685739f77f64929a13ed99e9068dc37 be76a4adb1ed4eb1be3c6809f69ff410
#: d244c83402454deabaedd19384b6eac6
msgid ""
"This is explained below in the section :ref:`How Parameters Work in "
"ArduPilot <how-params-work>`. Suffice it to say that there must a script "
"running that \"creates\" the new parameters as discussed below on any given "
"boot-up, in order to use them and for ground control stations like Mission "
"Planer to list them."
msgstr ""
"下文 :ref:`ArduPilot 中参数的工作原理 <how-params-work>` "
"一节对此有说明。简而言之，任何一次开机后都必须有一个脚本在运行并\"创建\"这些新参数（如下所述），才能使用它们，并让 Mission Planner "
"等地面站列出它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-parameters.rst:79
#: 5332451b79114ff68520b0d42432ce42 6aad412751dd499ea31de34dab0a08b4
#: 6abf04ea339648c1b1aa7b4f07123c30 82aecca5da52478e8d527b3c0c858cd9
#: f640fc9ad6cf47ed96f6d5e4b41b7f88
msgid ""
"LUA created parameters exist in the same manner as firmware created "
"parameters. User/Script changes are stored in non-volatile memory. But their"
" names only exist for a lookup if a \"param:add_table\" and "
"\"param:add_param\" has been executed after boot-up by a script. Then they "
"will appear in the GCS parameter list and can be accessed by name from LUA "
"scripts. Without this, the data would still exist in non-volatile memory, "
"but is invisible and non-existent for all intents and purposes."
msgstr ""
"LUA 创建的参数与固件创建的参数以相同方式存在。用户/脚本的修改保存在非易失性存储器中。但只有在开机后由脚本执行过 "
"\"param:add_table\" 和 \"param:add_param\"，其名称才能被查找到。此后它们才会出现在地面站参数列表中，并可在 "
"LUA 脚本中按名称访问。否则，数据虽然仍存在于非易失性存储器中，但实际上不可见，等同于不存在。"
